<title>USA: Availl names president Eric Anderson new CEO.</title>
<headline>Availl names president Eric Anderson new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aviall Inc  said it named its president and chief operating officer, Eric Anderson, to the additional post of chief executive, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Anderson, 48, replaces Chairman and Chief Executive Robert Lambert, who will keep his title of chairman, the company said.</p>
<p>Anderson has been president and chief operating officer of the company since June, the company said.</p>
</text>
